  for understanding what Kautsky was defending when he insisted on the
  'scientific' status of historical materialism: Bernstein was not merely
  revising tactical conclusions but rejecting the deterministic philosophy
  of history that underlay them. The contrast with Kautsky's own
  Darwinian-naturalist evolutionism is philosophically clarifying.

  POSITION: Revisionist/Bersteinian gradualism -- normative philosophy of
  history displacing structural necessity.
  },
  keywords  = {Bernstein, evolutionary-socialism, neo-Kantianism, revisionism, High},
